<div class="list-group list-group-flush portal-help-list">
    <div class="list-group-item"><strong>1. Set real environment</strong><div class="text-secondary">Update domain, database, mail, and payment keys in production env.</div></div>
    <div class="list-group-item"><strong>2. Review money queues</strong><div class="text-secondary">Approve or reject pending deposit and withdrawal requests before launch.</div></div>
    <div class="list-group-item"><strong>3. Cache safely</strong><div class="text-secondary">Run route/config/view cache only after all routes are verified.</div></div>
    <div class="list-group-item"><strong>4. Keep old admin isolated</strong><div class="text-secondary">Use /admin as the clean backend. Legacy screens stay at /legacy-admin for reference.</div></div>
</div>
